+
+# Highlights
+
+- ``devenv search`` now shows results from the options that can be set in `devenv.nix`:
+
+![devenv search results](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/126339/208920765-69044213-8977-4bb1-bd40-22cc00104ae4.png)
