+
+
+*Example:*
+
+```nix
+./rust-toolchain.toml
+```
+
+*Declared by:*
+ - [https://github.com/cachix/devenv/blob/main/src/modules/languages/rust.nix](https://github.com/cachix/devenv/blob/main/src/modules/languages/rust.nix)
