+*Type:*
+boolean
+
+
+
+*Default:*
+
+```nix
+false
+```
+
+
+
+*Example:*
+
+```nix
+true
+```
+
+*Declared by:*
+ - [https://github\.com/cachix/devenv/blob/main/src/modules/services/mosquitto\.nix](https://github.com/cachix/devenv/blob/main/src/modules/services/mosquitto.nix)
